{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>灣仔船街薄餅店!榴槤甜味炸薄餅</p><p>灣仔POCOFINO全新口味炸薄餅</p><p>灣仔船街正宗拿坡里薄餅外賣店 POCOFINO ，由拿坡里薄餅大師 Chef Matteo Minante 主理，亦是全港唯一獲 AVPN 認證拿坡里薄餅店。最近意籍主廚大膽以香港人至愛的蛋撻及榴槤做成炸甜薄餅，研發出顛覆想像的香港限定薄餅！</p><p>香港限定！蛋撻味炸薄餅</p><p>港人對蛋撻的執著無庸置疑，但將蛋撻炸成薄餅（Pizza Fritta） 又試過未？ Chef Matteo 以拿坡里百年街頭美食 Pizza Fritta 為基底，將 24 小時慢發酵的空氣感麵糰對摺，包包裹著幼滑濃郁的燉蛋內餡，下鍋炸至外層金黃酥脆。一咬開空氣感爆棚的薄餅皮夾雜住熱騰騰的蛋撻餡，外香脆、內嫩滑，顛覆飲食界對兩大國民美食的既定認知。</p><p>全新榴槤炸薄餅！</p><p>另一款全新榴槤炸薄餅，嚴選果香濃郁且質感綿密的菲律賓頂級榴槤果肉，加上高溫炸好的意式薄餅與拉絲芝士，啖啖榴槤果肉，徹底俘虜一眾榴槤愛好者！</p><p>POCOFINO 地址：灣仔船街 8 號地舖 營業時間：星期一至日7 am – 9:30 pm 官方IG：@pocofinohk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178824241657365871_2198599336a9669f12da7f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17882424186791600_4915562746a9669f312f56.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178824242035433623_10727212016a9669f4a59b3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178824242202367284_19288841206a9669f6c6d1a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178824242409662671_21283768736a9669f864a6f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178824242610659781_2478524936a9669fac6441.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178824242853627679_3093679266a9669fcf217e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178824243019038923_433834276a9669fe8b9f6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178824243197367711_6189821656a966a00b653b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T06:19:33.082582+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":564,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}